{"server":"cn","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_01_beg","groupId":"act46side","stageId":"act46side_01","title":"呼号声中","storyCode":"OS-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act46side/level_act46side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6ddb93e665460f7c598e1d460105f8f6ac1211734dc1f7f2c76b7930cd51132c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_G1_stationruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一队，把物资放到东边的空地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"配合佩尔罗契的增援一起搭建医疗帐篷，准备接收伤员！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二队，带上雪铲和酒袋，继续在火车站那边的废墟寻找幸存者。仔细搜，不要漏听呼救声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白！大家伙，带上东西跟我走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切记不要发出太大的声音，山上的情况还不清楚，不排除还有发生二次雪崩的可能。探查情况的小队已经在去往山顶的路上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我们的同伴，相信耶拉冈德正在庇佑着谢拉格人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉冈德在上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......耶拉冈德在上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉冈德在上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间不等人，立刻开始行动吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众救援队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"交叠在一起的回答声还未从冷风中散去，希瓦艾什家的侍从已经在雪地上散开，奔向各个方向。\n在这里的不只有他们，这场白色的崩溃显然在祥和的日子里造成了一片清晰的创口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_G1_stationruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，这里还有一个活着的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——撑住了！是个谢拉格人就给我咬着牙挺住了，别睡着！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"腿，我的腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的腿动不了，我的腿已经......呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别动！后面的，情况看清楚了没，到底怎么样？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挖开了，雪洞已经挖开了！但是他的腿被钢筋压住了，如果这玩意儿没断就只能找医生来......不对，先别急，我再挖开一点试试！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——嘿！呼......好消息，这钢筋已经完全断了，我们只要能抬起来就行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出力气能办好的事儿都不用担心，都过来，搭把手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓稳了，一、二、三"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——喝啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"痛、呃啊啊......好痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，有空当了，把他拖出来！尽快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拉住他了，轻一点，把他的身体抬起来，用布垫在底下，对，小心，别扯到他的伤口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样慢慢地拖出来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援队员","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！成了！担架，快点把担架弄过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让一让，让一让，担架到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"压抑着的、克制着的呼唤。救援。担架。生还者。\n白茫茫的雪地之上，无数人忙碌地奔跑着，脸颊滚烫，甚至溢出汗水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古罗，这边暂时交给你。看好了，能救活的一个也别放弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......您要去哪儿？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_G1_stationruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯老爷......南侧的救援难道已经结束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没，还没结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古罗在看着，我是来找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这里还算顺利，您不用担心。布朗陶的增援也到了，带来了不少毛毯和食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈塔托丝夫人本想亲自过来的，但似乎实在是分不开身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，想来也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家心里有数，没人会因为这个怪她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*谢拉格俚语*，怎么就碰上了这么场灾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次雪崩来得太突然了，没有一点征兆，我们所有人都没有预备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，就是这个，我要找你说的就是这个事儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道谢拉格的规矩，这雪崩发生的地方在佩尔罗契家的领地，我们负责照看领地内的雪山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一直在记录积雪的厚度，那记录我看了好几次，明明一切正常！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才来问你，你们那个什么研究院里不是还有人专门跑去看雪山的吗？那些人怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"研究院......您说莱茵生命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，他们天天在山上跑来跑去的，鼓捣什么高科技装备，总不能一点发现都没有吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按理来说应该是有的。但他们也有自己的任务，未必会把所有精力都放在研究雪山上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且雪崩发生后我们立刻就赶过来了，他们到底有没有发现什么我也并不确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯老爷也派了锏小姐带领队伍上山调查，估计很快就能回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，总觉得后背发凉，这场雪崩到底是什么毛病......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"山风夹杂着雪花，呼啸而来。小山一般高大的男人回头，他站在山脚下，沉默的山峰将他比较得如同一颗小石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"跌落的雪铺成一片白色，一行人正从山路上快速下撤。几步就到了二人近前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查队员","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰大人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调查队员","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得尽快通知恩希欧迪斯老爷！山上，山上发现——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"调查队员脸色发白，他的毛靴底部，被踩污的雪凝成一片湿润而冰冷的灰色。\n因为奔跑而急促的呼吸夹杂在风中，凝聚成一股令人不安的呜咽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对于框架协议，各位代表没有别的问题了，那么我们接下来开始讨论协议细则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"首先是第一项，关于谢拉格与卡西米尔的联合矿场的税务——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀兰贸易文员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）董事长，锏小姐有要事通报，正在门外等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......现在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喀兰贸易文员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）是，她说......非常紧急。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g11_karlanheadquarters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紧急的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"调查队在雪崩发生处的山上发现了这个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锏伸出手，她戴着手套，一小片漆黑的源石碎片静静地躺在她的手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在谢拉格的山上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果火车站旁边那座雪山还算谢拉格境内的话，没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺希斯和罗德岛的人都看过了，基本可以确认......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锏环顾四周，确认没有第三个人后，才压低声音说道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场雪崩，就是天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少人知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"调查队是我们的人，姑且还能控制，但是山下已经发现了不少感染的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"消息瞒不住太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知角峰，立刻封锁受灾现场，不要让运送货物的民众靠近。山上也要设置关口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"联系罗德岛，请他们对感染者的收治一定注意保密，需要什么帮助都可以联系喀兰贸易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再帮我转告菈塔托丝和阿克托斯，一个小时后在受灾的火车站见面，请他们务必要赶到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。还有别的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你带足人手，立刻去蔓珠院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同样......让诺希斯带人，去保护莱茵生命观测站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恩希欧迪斯理了理衣装，转身走进了会议室。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉各位，耽误了一点时间，让我们继续吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"首先是第一项，关于谢拉格与卡西米尔的联合矿场的税务......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g3_mainhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐......荒唐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的典籍都未记载过这样的预言。耶拉冈德怎么会用天灾来惩罚我们？这根本就是无稽之谈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可它已经发生了！祂已经因为愤怒，离我们而去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是耶拉冈德的怒火，我们又要如何解释现在发生的这场天灾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看此时此刻围在蔓珠院外的人们吧，他们都是耶拉冈德虔诚的信徒，是谢拉格善良的子民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我们要告诉他们，你们失去的亲人，你们遭受的苦难......全都是无妄之灾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"如今人心已经乱作一团，动摇信仰的声音不绝于耳......可越是如此，我们的信念越是要坚定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"我们怎知这不是耶拉冈德施予我们的考验，只是让我们信念坚定的考验？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉冈德没有舍弃谢拉格......耶拉冈德怎会无故惩罚谢拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道不是我们做了忤逆耶拉冈德的事，这才——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻修士看了看坐在大殿中央的圣女，又悻悻低下头去，不发一言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必顾虑，畅所欲言即可。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为，这是耶拉冈德的怒火，这是......这是警示......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许正是因为蔓珠院......因为我们做了错的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我们就不该同意那些无信仰之人在圣山上大兴土木，我们应该坚持，坚持拒绝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是那些人亵渎了耶拉冈德的圣殿——使祂发怒，谢拉格又怎么会......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的声音越来越低，声音中的颤抖却越来越少。整座大殿也跟着安静下来，无人出声反驳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您认为，是我作为圣女做出了冒犯耶拉冈德的决定，这才为谢拉格招致了这场天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是......圣女大人，我的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你的观点很有参考意义——如今不只是山下的信众，还有和我一同坐在这里的诸位，其中应该有不少人都怀抱着与你一样的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是如今的情况，人们对蔓珠院产生怀疑，而各位也心怀忐忑与摇摆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方戈修士还有罗纳亚修士，你们一个认为耶拉冈德仍如旧日一般眷顾我们，神恩永济；而另一个认为耶拉冈德已然......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女垂下头思考片刻。洁白的脸上几乎如同冰面一般平静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就请两位向我背诵，《耶拉冈德》中提及的三次“守护”吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"两位修士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......是，圣女大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一处守护，《耶拉冈德》，第七页第九行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“于是祂对身边的牧童说——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我将是你们的庇佑，我将是你们的依靠。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我会在林中狩猎，我将在土地中播种，让你们有皮子穿有东西吃，不至于冻死与饿死。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“这正是祂守护我们不被寒风与饥肠辘辘侵害的时候。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"第二处守护，《耶拉冈德》，第二十五页第十七行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"“所以守护者在人群中诞生了，他们在七彩的云霞之中苏醒，以雪水浇灌的泥土构建高墙。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_268","isRemote":false,"text":"“这正是祂守护我们的家宅与亲眷的时刻，赐予我们抵御外来之敌的技巧。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及......《耶拉冈德》，第三十九页第二行。最后一处提及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“那一日，祂在人群之中宣讲。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我的眼睛会看护你们，我的皮毛会温暖你们，我的脊骨会守护你们，我的血肉将成为对你们的赐福。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你们已经知晓风雪的道理，了解行走的姿态。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_2014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你们已是谢拉格的谢拉格人，这谢拉格的土地从此彻彻底底地......交到了谢拉格人的手上。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么请各位回答我，《耶拉冈德》可有一句提及，耶拉冈德会保护谢拉格永远不受天灾侵害吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道各位，是在代替耶拉冈德向祂的子民许诺吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"满座之中，不少修士低下头去不再言语。\n寂静得落针可闻。焚香的气息萦绕在每一个人鼻尖，却让他们觉得连呼吸都凝滞在如今的谈话中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓珠院长老","speakerId":"avg_npc_1998_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......圣女大人，言之有理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓珠院长老","speakerId":"avg_npc_1998_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾降临在了谢拉格，有人因此而死，更多人因此染病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓珠院长老","speakerId":"avg_npc_1998_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今这个消息已经传遍了整个雪境。恐惧、不安、进一步的悲伤甚至于愤怒，这些东西正在谢拉格人身上流淌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓珠院长老","speakerId":"avg_npc_1998_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要做的是为此寻找解决之法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是自然。现在不是我们争辩的时候。我所说的这些话也正是为了警示各位，不可陷入慌乱与偏执。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在座的各位，都是耶拉冈德的信徒，应当知晓言语的分量。从现在开始，蔓珠院众人不得再妄言耶拉冈德的惩罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从明天开始，我会进入藏经阁，全心解经，倾听祂的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿德颂长老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿德颂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1998_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你已经接任大长老之位，我闭关期间，蔓珠院事务一应由你代理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安抚信众，执行悼丧仪式，抄写赈灾慰灵的经文，一应事务不可落下。都要尽心尽力，诚恳而行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿德颂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1998_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们应该相信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢拉格曾经经历过无数风雪与难关，蔓珠院会永远与耶拉冈德的子民同在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g4_boudoir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，总算没出太大的乱子......"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女深深地呼出一口气，伏倒在桌案上，一直以来挺直如同雪中松柏的腰背终于卸力松垮下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不明白，为什么人们总是会将神明当作许愿机呢？为什么要将世上的一切幸运与不幸都归咎到神明身上呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，作为圣女是不该这样想，可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我也不明白，为什么偏偏在这个时候会有天灾发生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅儿，还是叫换衣的侍从们进来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丧礼仪式已经备好，从明日开始，我们就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅儿？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"呼唤声落下，房间中依旧寂静，唯有风声与火声交织。\n恩雅回过头，她这才发现房间内空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅儿......你在吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"原本应该时常陪伴在圣女身旁的侍女长消失无踪，只有恩雅一个人的影子被火光拖得又细又长，在昏暗的房间里不断闪烁跳跃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅儿......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大长老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恩雅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大长老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......诚实地告诉我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大长老","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你还能......听到耶拉冈德的声音吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"柴火燃烧的噼啪声在空荡荡的房间内回响。\n窗外的风依旧呼啸，似乎可以听见圣山之下，迷茫的信众嚎哭的声音。\n恩雅还记得初次来到这间属于圣女的房间时的感受。\n陌生的房间，不一样的气味，目所能及却再也不能以自己的名字返回的家，那时候的她也一样觉得这间房空荡如同雪洞。\n但是她已经习惯了有一个人在这里陪伴自己。有一个人可以让自己毫无顾虑地倾诉心事，可以让自己有所依赖。\n但此时......\n翻阅到一半的《耶拉冈德》古老的卷轴铺在桌面上，梳妆镜里映出少女茫然无措的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雅儿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你明明答应过我，不会忽然被带走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到底......到底发生了什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
